    <templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.9" extension="2014-06-09"/>
    <code code="51847-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Evaluation + Plan note"/>
    <title>Assessment and Plan</title>
    <text><list listType="ordered"><item><content styleCode="Bold">Periodic adult preventive visit completed</content>. Health risk assessment reviewed and the prevention plan made. First recombinant zoster vaccine dose, the pneumococcal conjugate vaccine and a tetanus booster given; colorectal cancer screening, HIV, hepatitis C and hepatitis B screening ordered; prostate cancer screening discussed. [S]<list><item>Second zoster vaccine dose in two to six months.</item><item>Next preventive visit in one year.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Post-frostbite neuropathic pain of the fingers (M79.2)</content>. Early on duloxetine 60 mg; tolerated, no drowsiness. [S]<list><item>Review at the twelve-week visit, as planned.</item></list></item><item><content styleCode="Bold">Cold-water bathing alone</content>. Daily cold salt-water immersion alone carries a risk of cold shock and drowning. [S]<list><item>Enter the water gradually, stay within his depth and close to the steps, and tell someone at the house when he bathes.</item></list></item></list><paragraph>Personalized prevention plan. A written copy was given to the patient. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Status</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Blood pressure</td><td>Completed today</td><td>128/80 mmHg</td></tr><tr><td>Depression screening</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PHQ-2 score 1; PHQ-9 5 at intake</td></tr><tr><td>Tobacco use</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Never used tobacco</td></tr><tr><td>Unhealthy alcohol use</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Rare use; no counseling needed</td></tr><tr><td>Colorectal cancer screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>Due from 45; no previous screening; he chose a yearly fecal immunochemical test, kit given</td></tr><tr><td>Prostate cancer screening</td><td>Declined</td><td>Shared decision about PSA screening at 55 to 69; after hearing the benefits and harms he chose not to be screened now</td></tr><tr><td>Lung cancer screening</td><td>Not indicated</td><td>Never smoked</td></tr><tr><td>Cholesterol and cardiovascular risk</td><td>Completed today</td><td>LDL cholesterol 126 mg/dL and HDL 58 at intake; ten-year risk about 6% by the Pooled Cohort Equations with no other risk factor, so a statin is not recommended</td></tr><tr><td>Diabetes</td><td>Up to date</td><td>HbA1c 5.4% and fasting glucose 94 mg/dL at intake</td></tr><tr><td>HIV screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time screening; offered to adults 15 to 65; drawn today with his agreement</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis C screening</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time antibody test for adults 18 to 79, drawn today</td></tr><tr><td>Hepatitis B screening and vaccination</td><td>Ordered</td><td>One-time triple panel drawn today; vaccination if he is not immune</td></tr><tr><td>Zoster vaccine</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Recombinant zoster vaccine dose 1 of 2 today</td></tr><tr><td>Pneumococcal vaccine</td><td>Completed today</td><td>PCV20 today; recommended for all adults 50 or older; no further dose needed</td></tr><tr><td>Tetanus, diphtheria, and pertussis</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Tdap today; no dose recorded in the last ten years</td></tr><tr><td>Influenza vaccine</td><td>Due</td><td>Next autumn</td></tr><tr><td>Vision</td><td>Up to date</td><td>Corrected vision 6/6; optometry review every two years for his myopia</td></tr><tr><td>Skin cancer counseling</td><td>Completed today</td><td>Sun and snow-glare protection discussed</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>Immunizations given today: Recombinant zoster vaccine, dose 1 of 2; Pneumococcal conjugate vaccine (PCV20); Tdap vaccine [S]</paragraph><paragraph>Guideline basis: Neuropathic pain in adults: pharmacological management in non-specialist settings (CG173) (2013, updated 2020); Medicare Preventive Services reference: visit templates, screening cascades, and documentation elements (2026); USPSTF A and B Recommendations (2026); Adult Immunization Schedule by Age (2026)</paragraph><paragraph>Follow-up: Twelve-week review in four weeks. Screening results through the patient portal. Next scheduled visit 1928-05-05: twelve-week review: finger pain, mood, blood pressure and sodium on duloxetine. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
