    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Voluntary advance care planning discussion of about 20 minutes, with his consent, because he often travels in remote polar regions. He named a health care agent and a second agent, and a health care proxy form was completed; both are recorded in the chart and are not named here. He wants full treatment if he is ill or injured. He asked for a short medical summary to carry when he travels. The plan will be revisited after any serious illness or before his next long journey. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
